NOTE ON SOURCE MATERIALS

The MIT license above covers the original work in this repository: the skill
structure, router, topic index, README, and the distillation text as written
here.

It does not and cannot relicense the underlying sources, which remain under
their own terms. Several are open educational resources with their own
licenses (Open Neuroscience Initiative is CC BY-NC 4.0; CompCogNeuro ed4,
Nipraxis, and Andy's Brain Book carry their own terms). Others are
commercially published works (Springer, MIT Press, Oxford University Press,
Academic Press) whose rights are held by their publishers.

The reference files are structural summaries — frameworks, terminology, and
decision rules restated in condensed form — not reproductions of the source
texts. Anyone redistributing or building on this repository should check the
terms of the individual source before doing so.
